<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Plataforma de Bilhetes — Culturalia®</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0e0e0e;
      --text-main: #f5f3ef;
      --text-muted: #9e9b95;
      --accent-gold: #c8a97e;
      --border-subtle: rgba(245, 243, 239, 0.12);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* Cabeçalho minimalista */
    header {
      padding: 1.75rem 5%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .logo-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .logo-img {
      height: 44px;
      width: auto;
      display: block;
    }

    .status-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200, 169, 126, 0.35);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    }

    /* Conteúdo Central */
    main {
      padding: 4rem 5%;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--accent-gold);
      font-weight: 600;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.8rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--accent-gold);
    }

    p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 48px;
      height: 1px;
      background-color: var(--accent-gold);
      margin: 2.5rem auto;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .cities {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Rodapé minimalista */
    footer {
      padding: 1.75rem 5%;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    footer a:hover {
      color: var(--accent-gold);
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header, footer {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }

      .logo-img {
        height: 36px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <a href="https://culturalia.pt" class="logo-link" aria-label="Culturalia®">
      <img 
        src="https://culturalia.pt/assets/img/culturalia-horizontal-simbolo-negativo.svg" 
        alt="Culturalia® — Agência Cultural e Tecnológica" 
        class="logo-img"
      >
    </a>
    <span class="status-badge">Em breve</span>
  </header>

  <main>
    <span class="eyebrow">Em Desenvolvimento</span>
    <h1>Plataforma de Checkin</h1>
    
    <div class="divider"></div>
    
    <div class="cities">Se chegou aqui e não sabe o link do evento, contacte o supervisor.</div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>© Culturalia® 2021 – 2026 · Marca registada no INPI</span>
    <a href="https://culturalia.pt" target="_blank" rel="noopener">culturalia.pt</a>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
